window.EN={"1":"Having settled the bandit trouble at Purple Dragon Mountain, Leif's \"Liberation Army,\"","2":"in order to join the surviving retainers of Leonster, whom they had learned were safe,","3":"heads for Hannibal's mountain villa, where they are said to be living in hiding...","4":"Merloch, it is around here, yes?","5":"Sir. There is no mistake.","6":"Even so, those bandits, to torment my people of Thracia... they will not get off lightly.","7":"Even so, there was no need for you to come all the way out here yourself, Father...","8":"No. One who is king must know of every matter, however trifling.","9":"Besides, Altena, it has been a long time since I went on an outing with you. It is fine.","10":"Yes. I am happy to be with you, Father.","11":"I invited Arion as well, but he had the nerve to say he could not leave the main castle unattended. An unsociable fellow.","12":"My brother is working hard because he wants to be of help to you, Father.","13":"Well, when I was his age, I was managing everything as king.","14":"Arion, too, will have to work hard, but...","15":"I, too, want to do my utmost and be of help to you and my brother, Father.","16":"Yes. To the two of you I wish to entrust the future of this Thracia.","17":"In the north, rich harvests cover the fields; in the south, great wealth lies buried in the mountains.","18":"If either is lacking, Thracia cannot stand on its own.","19":"To make this Thracia one again... yes, to return it to the ideal country that Dain and Nova built: that is my wish.","20":"For that, I would not shrink even from falling into hell...","21":"...Father?","22":"Altena...","23":"Yes.","24":"...The wind seems to have picked up. Shall we leave this to Merloch and go back?","25":"Yes, Father!","26":"Mm. Merloch!","27":"Sir!","28":"I leave the rest to you. I have given you this many soldiers. I will absolutely not tolerate failure!","29":"Wipe out the bandits. Kill every last one.","30":"Teach them how dearly they will pay for tormenting my people!","31":"Sir, leave it to me!","32":"Father! It's the Thracian army! They're attacking up across the whole south!!","33":"Travant, so he has noticed us!","34":"But this is bad.","35":"Glade has gone to Tahra. All who are in this villa now are youths who have never known real battle.","36":"I will draw the enemy off. Father, take them and escape.","37":"That won't do. According to word from General Hannibal,","38":"Lord Leif is leading the warriors of Fiana and Munster and heading this way.","39":"I must wait for the prince.","40":"Understood. Then I will take command of the defense.","41":"Until the prince arrives, I will hold out, you'll see.","42":"Cain! Alva! Robert!","43":"We're heading out! Follow me!","44":"That is the villa we are looking for.","45":"I wonder if everyone is well...","46":"...There seems to be an army around it. Is it Dorias and the others?","47":"An army, you say? ...This is bad! That equipment is the Thracian army's!","48":"What!? Isn't that General Hannibal's villa?","49":"Perhaps those in hiding were discovered. Or else General Hannibal informed on them...","50":"Stop it, August! General Hannibal is not that kind of man.","51":"...In any case, we must go to their aid.","52":"Should the villa fall, the liberation of Thracia and the rebuilding of Leonster would be all but hopeless.","53":"Lord Leif! How I've missed you!! It's me! Selphina!","54":"Selphina! Is it really you, Selphina!","55":"Lord Leif... truly... this isn't a dream, is it?","56":"That little Lord Leif... the Lord Leif who used to sleep so comfortably on my lap...","57":"has grown up so splendidly... Ahh, what can I say...","58":"Selphina, I'm the one who feels like crying.","59":"I was sure you and Dorias had both been killed because of me...","60":"I never imagined I could see you again...","61":"I don't remember my mother or my sister. I don't know the warmth of family.","62":"So I thought of Lachesis as a mother, and of you, Selphina, as an older sister.","63":"I was always asking impossible things of you. I still remember it clearly.","64":"Lord Leif... Such words... are more than I deserve...","65":"...Lady Lachesis has still not returned...?","66":"No... She went off to Isaach and hasn't come back...","67":"...I see...","68":"It will be all right. This is Lady Lachesis. I'm sure she is living well somewhere.","69":"Surely, surely you'll meet again, Lord Leif. After all, even we were able to meet.","70":"Sir Finn, it has been a long time!","71":"You are...?","72":"Have you forgotten me? It's Selphina, Sir Finn.","73":"Selphina? Count Dorias's daughter?","74":"Yes.","75":"...It can't be... that girl with the braids...","76":"A woman changes in ten years. And I am Glade's wife now.","77":"Glade!? Is he safe? I want to see him! Let me see him!","78":"He is away at present. He has gone to the relief of Tahra...","79":"I see... That's a pity. If it's military duty, it can't be helped, but...","80":"It seems you are more interested in Glade than in me, Sir Finn.","81":"You haven't changed at all since the old days. You always were cold to women.","82":"Cold? ...I don't mean to be...","83":"Then why did you leave Lady Lachesis alone?","84":"You must have understood her sorrow...","85":"...I don't know what you are talking about...","86":"No! You do understand, Sir Finn.","87":"And yet you pretend not to. That is cowardly of you, Sir Finn!","88":"Selphina, we are meeting for the first time in so long. That's enough, surely...","89":"Oh... I'm sorry. You're right.","90":"We meet after so long, and I say nothing but rude things...","91":"No, it's fine. Let me hear about that another time. For now, we must fight.","92":"Yes, Sir Finn...","93":"Lady Selphina, I have just returned.","94":"Carrion, thank you for carrying out such an important duty.","95":"No, this is about all someone like me can be of use for.","96":"I, too, hope to quickly become a splendid knight like Sir Glade","97":"and be of use to Lord Leif, but... I can't stand how powerless I am.","98":"Carrion, you mustn't be impatient. That is how one loses one's life.","99":"But perhaps it is about time I gave you this.","100":"What is this...? It's quite a splendid sword...","101":"This is what is called the Elite Sword. I was keeping it for your mother.","102":"She asked me to give it to you when you had become a fine knight...","103":"My mother!?","104":"Yes. When she passed away from illness, you were still small...","105":"I'm told this sword was the favorite of your father, who died in battle.","106":"My father's... The sword of my father, who was a paladin of Leonster...","107":"That's right. You must treasure it.","108":"Yes! Lady Selphina, thank you so much!!","109":"Lord Leif! Terrible news! The villa has fallen!","110":"What!? Then Dorias and the others...","111":"I am told nearly all of Leonster's former retainers had gathered at this villa.","112":"Now that they have been wiped out,","113":"regrettably, there is nothing for it but to give up on rebuilding the Kingdom of Leonster.","114":"Dorias!!","115":"Lord Leif... How good that you are safe... You have grown up splendidly...","116":"It's all thanks to you and Finn, Dorias.","117":"Thanks to your sacrifices, I have been able to live this long...","118":"Such undeserved words... Ah, how unlike me...","119":"Perhaps it is my age, but I have become easily moved to tears...","120":"Age? Don't say that...","121":"!! Dorias! Your right arm... it can't be...","122":"Ah, this? No, it is nothing much.","123":"In the battle at Ulster, I let my guard down a little... It is embarrassing.","124":"At Ulster... Then, to let us escape...","125":"H-how terrible! For my sake... for my sake, Dorias, you...","126":"Hahaha. You need not let it trouble you so.","127":"This decrepit old body was never of much use to begin with.","128":"More importantly, Lord Leif, if you are going to Tahra, there is no time to dawdle.","129":"According to word from Glade, the Empire's all-out attack looks set to begin shortly.","130":"Now, beneath the battle flag of Nova, the brave have gathered.","131":"The reborn army of the Kingdom of Leonster, let us set forth to liberate northern Thracia!!","132":"For that, first, there are the Thracian soldiers outside.","133":"On that matter, the Thracian army's movements are somehow strange.","134":"They have stopped attacking us and are not moving.","135":"That's odd...","136":"Lord Leif, thinking about it will get us nowhere. I will go and take a quick look. Please wait here a moment.","137":"Hmm, it is as that man said. They have stopped attacking us.","138":"But what on earth has happened?","139":"Hm? What? That female dragon knight... she seems to be about to say something to the Thracian army...","140":"I address the whole Thracian army. I am Princess Altena.","141":"Urgent word has come from General Hannibal.","142":"Those in this villa are not bandits.","143":"They are, I am told, a mercenary unit the general organized to protect the people from bandits.","144":"Therefore, further fighting is needless! All troops, withdraw at once!","145":"Hmm, the bandits still haven't been wiped out?","146":"It can't be helped. Send the signal to charge to the lance armor unit.","147":"Curse you, what are you dawdling for! All troops, we now move to an all-out attack. Sweep away the bandits at all costs!","148":"Are you acquainted with the people living in the villa?","149":"I found this in the hills out back; I wonder if it belongs to them. Please take it to them.","150":"You're looking a bit pale. Aren't you working too hard?","151":"At times like that, I recommend this S Drink.","152":"Gulp down one bottle into a tired body, and in an instant you're bursting with energy. It's great stuff.","153":"Even when someone's too tired to sortie, just having them carry it does the trick.","154":"I'll give you one as a sample, so if you like it, buy some at the item shop next door.","155":"Miss it here, and the only other place that sells it is the city of Tahra.","156":"You'd better buy some even if it takes all the money you've got.","157":"You people aren't bandits! Who on earth are you!","158":"Your Majesty King Travant, forgive me..."};
